---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>

    <p class="mt-4 text-zinc-600">
      I’m Tessa — an Electrical & Computer Engineer focused on embedded systems, digital system design, FPGA/RTL Design, and VLSI.
      I’m currently in the MS ECE program at The University of Illinois at Chicago (Digital Systems / VLSI track) with an expected graduation date of Spring 2027.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-zinc-600">
      <p>
         In 2024, I earned my BS in ECE from The University of Texas at Austin where I specialized in computer architecture and embedded systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        I like building reliable hardware-software systems, getting deep into debugging, and documenting what I learn.
      </p>
      <p>
        Interests: firmware, RTL/FPGA, sensor systems, and design verification.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

